<title>UK: Chesterton appoints Michael Holmes as CEO.</title>
<headline>Chesterton appoints Michael Holmes as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property consultancy and facilities management group Chesterton International Plc said on Thursday it had apppointed Michael Holmes as group chief executive.</p>
<p>Holmes previously worked at Rentokil Initial Plc. He succeeds Giles Ballantine who stepped down in September last year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
